        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_check_and_reserve_ost",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_check_and_reserve_ost\n\nAdd lod_check_reserve_test, covering lod_check_and_reserve_ost(),\nthe per-candidate-OST gate shared by the RR and QoS allocators: it\nstatfs-checks the target, skips it for various transient/degraded\nreasons, and on success declares and reserves a new object on it.\n\nCovers a healthy OST being reserved (advancing *s_idx and filling in\nstripe[]/ost_indices[]), a full OST being skipped (rc returned,\n*s_idx unchanged), and an already-used OST being re-used only when\noverstriping is requested.\n\nExport lod_check_and_reserve_ost() and declare it in lod_internal.h\nso the test module can call it directly. Register the new module in\nlustre/kunit/Makefile, lustre/kunit/KUNIT.modules_list and\nlustre/lod/KUNIT.list.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [claude-code]\nChange-Id: Ifa0837016172304999c731e6bfb2476e0276a654\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
